/* 🚚 LOADING THE VAN. Owner, 2026-08-18, scanning bags onto the truck: "the app does not tell me that i
   am missing anything... i should see the list of missing items shrink away after i rack them to truck, but
   it seemed static." It was static because it was EMPTY: the panel filtered on promise <= TODAY, and the van
   is loaded the EVENING BEFORE the run — so on a Tuesday every one of Wednesday's orders was invisible to it.
   26 orders were due the next day and Carthew 3-08-18-26-0005, five garments, was not on the van. */
section('🚚 what is due for the run being loaded, and not on the van');
